 "about": "P-165 draft (fix-g0-box): g-fastshort-g0 (P-164, 38d7fe5d7fa8) with fixed repeats: the approach runs exactly 12 drags and each re-approach exactly 2, with no until atEnd exit. On the original page (v0) drag 11 settled 6 px further (5220, Simulator 05:4xZ), atEnd held there, so g0 skipped drag 12 and the first re-approach and played the E strokes out of phase. Fixed repeats make both arms reach the jack the same way. The strokes, marks, profiles, pauses and the optional atEnd + y>=3000 guards are as in g0.",
